Dialogue: 5,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}What's faster:
Dialogue: 5,0:00:01.23,0:00:02.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}light, sound, or a thought?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:03.06,0:00:04.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Light in a vacuum travels
Dialogue: 5,0:00:04.75,0:00:06.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}almost three hundred million
Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.37,0:00:07.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}meters per second.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:07.58,0:00:08.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Sound in air
Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.50,0:00:10.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}at twenty degrees Celsius?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:10.37,0:00:11.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}About three hundred forty-three.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Your nerve signals?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:13.53,0:00:14.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Roughly half a meter
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.78,0:00:15.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}to over a hundred
Dialogue: 5,0:00:15.60,0:00:16.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}meters per second,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:16.83,0:00:17.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}depending on the fiber.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:18.18,0:00:19.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}But a thought doesn't have
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}one travel speed.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:20.51,0:00:22.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}It's signals plus processing
Dialogue: 5,0:00:22.21,0:00:23.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}across a network.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Imagining the Moon instantly
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.25,0:00:27.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}doesn't send anything there.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.58,0:00:29.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Thinking time and travel speed
Dialogue: 5,0:00:29.37,0:00:30.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}aren't the same thing.
